{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05227","headline":"海上作 · 宋务光","name":"海上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旷哉潮汐池，大矣乾坤力。\n浩浩去无际，沄沄深不测。\n崩腾翕衆流，泱漭环中国。\n鳞介错殊品，氛霞饶诡色。\n天波混莫分，岛树遥难识。\n汉主探灵怪，秦王恣游陟。\n搜奇大壑东，竦望成山北。\n方术徒相误，蓬莱安可得。\n吾君略仙道，至化孚淳默。\n惊浪晏穷溟，飞航通绝域。\n马韩底厥贡，龙伯修其职。\n粤我遘休明，匪躬期正直。\n敢输鹰隼执，以间豺狼忒。\n海路行已殚，輶轩未皇息。\n劳歌玄月暮，旅睇沧浪极。\n魏阙渺云端，驰心附归冀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋务光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}